1
00:00:08,070 --> 00:00:10,531
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">FROM ME TO YOU: KIMI NI TODOKE</font>

2
00:01:02,875 --> 00:01:07,838
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That being said... me being drawn to
Kazehaya's kindness, cheerfulness,</font>

3
00:01:07,922 --> 00:01:12,843
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">...overwhelming positivity, and
honesty? ...That's one hundred percent fact.</font>

4
00:01:12,927 --> 00:01:13,719
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So that part...</font>

5
00:01:15,638 --> 00:01:17,515
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">...Was not a misunderstanding.</font>

6
00:01:31,278 --> 00:01:34,281
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's... okay to get my hopes up, right?</font>

7
00:01:36,575 --> 00:01:39,954
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">About ' being able to
see you over Summer break?</font>

8
00:01:50,881 --> 00:01:57,805
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">SEATING CHANGE</font>

9
00:02:06,772 --> 00:02:09,733
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}PLEASE ADOPT ME</font>

10
00:02:17,867 --> 00:02:20,161
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">My name... is Sawako Kuronuma.</font>

11
00:02:22,872 --> 00:02:25,791
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I hope a good person takes you home.</font>

12
00:02:31,755 --> 00:02:34,008
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">My nickname is Sadako.</font>

13
00:02:34,091 --> 00:02:36,760
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yes, like "Sadako" from The Ring.</font>

14
00:02:38,429 --> 00:02:41,724
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">My motto is "Perform one good deed a day."</font>

15
00:02:44,894 --> 00:02:47,855
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Did you hear? About Sadako from Class D?
- The girl with the</font>

16
00:02:47,938 --> 00:02:49,815
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">strong psychic abilities?</font>

17
00:02:49,899 --> 00:02:52,067
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Uh-huh... Right before summer break...</font>

18
00:02:52,151 --> 00:02:56,447
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- ...She was rejected in front of her class!
- She was? But who was it by?</font>

19
00:02:57,448 --> 00:02:58,282
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ka-ze-ha-ya!</font>

20
00:02:59,575 --> 00:03:00,492
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Kazehaya?!
- Kazehaya?!</font>

21
00:03:01,827 --> 00:03:04,622
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kazehaya and Sadako would never...</font>

22
00:03:06,790 --> 00:03:09,585
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hi. Good morning.</font>

23
00:03:15,299 --> 00:03:18,802
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh, I see. It's because I spoke to them
out of nowhere. -I didn't mean to spook</font>

24
00:03:18,886 --> 00:03:22,556
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">you. Sorry. -She's praying.</font>

25
00:03:22,640 --> 00:03:25,226
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Is something there that we can't see?</font>

26
00:03:26,393 --> 00:03:30,856
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- I wonder how that poor puppy is doing?
- Why's she... staring off into space?</font>

27
00:03:30,940 --> 00:03:35,444
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- And why is she completely drenched?
- Hmm?</font>

28
00:03:37,404 --> 00:03:42,952
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Communicating with others is complicated...
and it doesn't always go well for me. But</font>

29
00:03:43,035 --> 00:03:49,041
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">even if it's hard... I'd still like
to tear down the walls between us.</font>

30
00:03:49,124 --> 00:03:50,042
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Morning!</font>

31
00:03:51,794 --> 00:03:56,090
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Woah, Kazehaya, you're totally drenched.
- Yeah, I got hella rained on.</font>

32
00:03:56,173 --> 00:04:00,511
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Amazing! He's surrounded by people in an
instant! -That's Kazehaya for ya. Not even</font>

33
00:04:00,594 --> 00:04:05,015
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">the rain clouds can block out
his sunshine! -You'll get sick!</font>

34
00:04:13,357 --> 00:04:14,275
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Morning.</font>

35
00:04:17,569 --> 00:04:18,487
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">M- Morning.</font>

36
00:04:19,280 --> 00:04:23,200
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">All that confusion I caused must have been
such a pain for him, but he keeps talking</font>

37
00:04:23,284 --> 00:04:27,204
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">to me like normal.
He's such a good person!</font>

38
00:04:27,288 --> 00:04:31,208
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You got rained on too, huh? You're
drenched... Got a change of clothes?</font>

39
00:04:31,292 --> 00:04:33,836
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Whoa, looks like Kazehaya's
trying to make up with her.</font>

40
00:04:33,919 --> 00:04:36,797
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Change of clothes?</font>

41
00:04:36,880 --> 00:04:40,467
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I see, if I had my tracksuit, I could
be prepared for situations like this.</font>

42
00:04:40,551 --> 00:04:44,138
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So you don't have any?</font>

43
00:04:45,264 --> 00:04:47,433
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah... that ramen... was so...</font>

44
00:04:47,516 --> 00:04:49,018
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Yoshida!
- Hm?</font>

45
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:50,394
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Didn't you have a spare
tracksuit around here?</font>

46
00:04:50,477 --> 00:04:52,062
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah... I do...</font>

47
00:04:54,440 --> 00:04:56,900
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- What the heck happened?!
- Sadako, you don't</font>

48
00:04:56,984 --> 00:04:59,486
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}have a change of clothes?</font>

49
00:05:00,446 --> 00:05:01,864
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Fine, I gotchu...</font>

50
00:05:04,533 --> 00:05:07,870
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Oh, here it is!
- Ta-da!</font>

51
00:05:07,953 --> 00:05:13,917
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Are you kidding me? Ew! Smells like mold.
- Here! Oh, can you wash it for me?</font>

52
00:05:14,960 --> 00:05:16,920
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Th- Tha- Thanks so much!</font>

53
00:05:20,007 --> 00:05:23,093
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">A handkerchief isn't enough, right?</font>

54
00:05:23,177 --> 00:05:26,180
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I used this earlier...
sorry it's kinda damp!</font>

55
00:05:27,931 --> 00:05:29,266
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Th- Th-thank you.</font>

56
00:05:32,227 --> 00:05:37,858
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's true that communicating with others
can be difficult... ...but I also feel like</font>

57
00:05:37,941 --> 00:05:43,655
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">there are so many good, kind people
out there these days. All around me.</font>

58
00:05:43,739 --> 00:05:46,533
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}I'm so happy! I can't believe a
classmate let me borrow something of</font>

59
00:05:46,617 --> 00:05:49,620
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">theirs.</font>

60
00:05:49,703 --> 00:05:52,748
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'd like to thank everyone somehow.</font>

61
00:05:52,831 --> 00:05:53,957
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Huh? Ojizo-san?!</font>

62
00:05:55,417 --> 00:05:59,797
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">When I think about it, the whole reason
I've had the chance to get closer to Yano</font>

63
00:05:59,880 --> 00:06:04,259
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">and Yoshida... is because of Kazehaya.
He's amazing... I admire and respect him</font>

64
00:06:04,343 --> 00:06:08,680
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">more with each passing day...</font>

65
00:06:10,015 --> 00:06:13,936
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kazehaya, you don't need
to worry about it so much.</font>

66
00:06:14,019 --> 00:06:15,437
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I mean Sadako.</font>

67
00:06:15,521 --> 00:06:17,940
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I get that you're feeling
bad about rejecting her, but...</font>

68
00:06:18,023 --> 00:06:20,609
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I didn't reject her.</font>

69
00:06:20,692 --> 00:06:23,320
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Wha-?! ' Don't tell me
you said "yes" to her!</font>

70
00:06:23,946 --> 00:06:26,615
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You've got it all twisted.</font>

71
00:06:27,199 --> 00:06:29,785
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's... okay to get my hopes up, right?</font>

72
00:06:30,828 --> 00:06:34,039
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">About being able to see
you over Summer break?</font>

73
00:06:37,292 --> 00:06:41,338
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So, you mean... I can see you
over break at summer school?</font>

74
00:06:44,466 --> 00:06:46,927
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Like, if you see me at
summer school, you won't avoid me?</font>

75
00:06:47,010 --> 00:06:49,513
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">K-Kuronuma?</font>

76
00:06:51,306 --> 00:06:56,478
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You know... I've always admired you
so much... I want to be just like you.</font>

77
00:06:57,229 --> 00:07:00,732
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I look up to you
Kazehaya, because you inspire me!</font>

78
00:07:02,025 --> 00:07:05,737
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And that feeling... it
won't... it won't ever change.</font>

79
00:07:10,367 --> 00:07:15,873
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So by "drawn" to me, she meant like
admiration? I've been so full of myself.</font>

80
00:07:15,956 --> 00:07:18,333
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Thank you... ' f-for just being you.</font>

81
00:07:21,795 --> 00:07:22,713
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kazehaya?</font>

82
00:07:23,255 --> 00:07:26,925
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Uh... It's not about accepting or rejecting.</font>

83
00:07:27,009 --> 00:07:30,846
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- It's not anything like that.
- What? I don't get a thing you're saying.</font>

84
00:07:30,929 --> 00:07:34,933
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">The one who didn't get it... is me.</font>

85
00:07:35,017 --> 00:07:38,437
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">No. Pretty sure I'm the lost one here.</font>

86
00:07:40,063 --> 00:07:44,568
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Before, when I thought about talking to
others, all I could think about was how I</font>

87
00:07:44,651 --> 00:07:49,156
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">might bother them. But when I talk to
Kazehaya, he never makes me feel bad. He</font>

88
00:07:49,239 --> 00:07:53,911
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">always gently guides me
in the right direction.</font>

89
00:07:53,994 --> 00:07:55,662
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">COFFEE</font>

90
00:07:57,456 --> 00:07:58,582
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hm?</font>

91
00:07:58,665 --> 00:08:02,544
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- What do we have here?
- There's one at mine too. ~ Hm?</font>

92
00:08:03,879 --> 00:08:06,965
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Oh, Sadako left those there earlier.
- Why did she give one to me as well?</font>

93
00:08:07,049 --> 00:08:10,427
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sadako's thank you gift!</font>

94
00:08:10,511 --> 00:08:13,680
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">This girl. You are
such a sucker for gifts.</font>

95
00:08:16,266 --> 00:08:21,021
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I never knew before... that tears
come out when you're happy too.</font>

96
00:08:27,110 --> 00:08:28,570
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kuronuma!</font>

97
00:08:28,654 --> 00:08:31,365
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey! Did you leave this for me?</font>

98
00:08:36,036 --> 00:08:38,455
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Y- Yeah, it was for the towel.</font>

99
00:08:38,539 --> 00:08:41,208
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So, you did. Next time tell me
so that I know who it's from.</font>

100
00:08:41,291 --> 00:08:43,961
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I I'm so sorry!</font>

101
00:08:47,339 --> 00:08:50,050
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm just glad it was you, Kuronuma. I
was worried I guessed wrong for a second</font>

102
00:08:50,133 --> 00:08:52,803
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">there.</font>

103
00:08:52,886 --> 00:08:56,431
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Since I have a tendency to do things
without thinking. And also, I thought I</font>

104
00:08:56,515 --> 00:09:00,477
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">overdid it when I gave my towel to you.</font>

105
00:09:00,561 --> 00:09:03,188
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">In fact... I'm even a
little nervous right now.</font>

106
00:09:05,148 --> 00:09:06,358
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Know what I mean?</font>

107
00:09:07,359 --> 00:09:09,987
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey... you're, like, sure
Sadako was rejected by him, right?</font>

108
00:09:10,070 --> 00:09:12,698
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Hm? Yeah.
- You got yourself a milk?</font>

109
00:09:13,323 --> 00:09:15,242
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh... Actually I got
this to bring to a dog.</font>

110
00:09:15,325 --> 00:09:17,286
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Do you... like dogs?</font>

111
00:09:17,828 --> 00:09:20,706
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I just saw one today. All alone though.</font>

112
00:09:21,373 --> 00:09:22,207
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You saw one?</font>

113
00:09:22,833 --> 00:09:24,960
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">My uniform got wet,
'cause I was playing with it.</font>

114
00:09:25,043 --> 00:09:27,170
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">By... the riverbed?</font>

115
00:09:28,088 --> 00:09:29,006
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Huh?</font>

116
00:09:35,220 --> 00:09:36,513
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Over here!</font>

117
00:09:36,597 --> 00:09:39,016
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}PLEASE ADOPT ME</font>

118
00:09:39,808 --> 00:09:43,228
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ah, so the umbrella keeping this guy safe
was yours. -That's why you were drenched</font>

119
00:09:43,312 --> 00:09:47,024
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">this morning. -How embarrassing.</font>

120
00:09:47,107 --> 00:09:50,319
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah. Look at that...
your name's even on it.</font>

121
00:09:50,402 --> 00:09:53,864
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Because I've had the same one
since elementary school. Oh...</font>

122
00:09:55,866 --> 00:09:58,452
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Can I... take this little fella home?</font>

123
00:09:59,161 --> 00:10:00,996
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh! For real?!</font>

124
00:10:01,747 --> 00:10:03,582
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Stop that!</font>

125
00:10:03,665 --> 00:10:07,336
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Hey don't worry... I'm kinda immune to it.
- I-Immune?</font>

126
00:10:07,419 --> 00:10:12,966
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">As long as I can remember, animals
have been scared of me. And children too.</font>

127
00:10:13,050 --> 00:10:15,510
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But I... really like dogs... A lot.</font>

128
00:10:18,055 --> 00:10:22,517
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh yeah! Don't they say dogs warm up to
people more easily if they see their</font>

129
00:10:22,601 --> 00:10:27,189
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">owner's being close with them?
Hey! Lookit! We're super close!</font>

130
00:10:27,272 --> 00:10:28,899
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">W- ~ We're close?</font>

131
00:10:30,942 --> 00:10:33,403
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">There. See? ... Everything's okay.</font>

132
00:10:38,116 --> 00:10:43,914
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">When Kazehaya says that to me... it's
strange, but it really does feel that way.</font>

133
00:10:44,665 --> 00:10:48,168
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">No matter where he is...
he's always like this.</font>

134
00:10:48,710 --> 00:10:51,963
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">There's never any distance between him and
everyone else. That's why everyone likes</font>

135
00:10:52,047 --> 00:10:55,258
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">him so much.</font>

136
00:10:55,342 --> 00:10:57,969
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Even dogs feel the same way...</font>

137
00:10:58,053 --> 00:11:01,682
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Someday... I'd like to break down some of
the walls between me and everyone else as</font>

138
00:11:01,765 --> 00:11:05,435
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">well... Even if it takes time...</font>

139
00:11:06,061 --> 00:11:06,978
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I want...</font>

140
00:11:09,564 --> 00:11:11,858
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">...To be... closer with everyone.</font>

141
00:11:16,488 --> 00:11:18,115
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'll try my best.</font>

142
00:11:19,282 --> 00:11:20,742
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah... You got this!</font>

143
00:11:22,703 --> 00:11:24,121
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You'll be just fine.</font>

144
00:11:25,831 --> 00:11:26,748
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah.</font>

145
00:11:31,545 --> 00:11:32,838
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">See ya!</font>

146
00:11:32,921 --> 00:11:35,924
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">U-Um, if it isn't too much trouble...</font>

147
00:11:36,717 --> 00:11:37,926
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hm?</font>

148
00:11:38,009 --> 00:11:40,387
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Would... you let me see him again?</font>

149
00:11:42,264 --> 00:11:44,850
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Really? Just the dog? And not me?</font>

150
00:11:45,851 --> 00:11:48,729
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}Of course I wanna see you too! I just-!</font>

151
00:11:52,441 --> 00:11:53,358
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Then okay!</font>

152
00:11:54,443 --> 00:11:58,905
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You know what... Kazehaya?...
I've noticed something strange.</font>

153
00:11:59,531 --> 00:12:03,952
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I don't know why... But for some reason,
that wall I've always felt between me and</font>

154
00:12:04,035 --> 00:12:08,457
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">everyone else... doesn't seem to exist
between me and you. This is the first</font>

155
00:12:08,540 --> 00:12:13,003
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">time... I've ever felt this way.</font>

156
00:12:16,339 --> 00:12:20,469
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I want to give everyone these thank-you
gifts for yesterday... should I wait until</font>

157
00:12:20,552 --> 00:12:24,639
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">after school? Maybe at a
place where no-one's around...</font>

158
00:12:24,723 --> 00:12:28,727
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">... But will they even want to eat them?...
They are homemade after all. Maybe I went</font>

159
00:12:28,810 --> 00:12:32,856
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">a little overboard...</font>

160
00:12:33,398 --> 00:12:34,316
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hmm...</font>

161
00:12:36,401 --> 00:12:39,821
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ugh... Now my anxiety... is through the roof.</font>

162
00:12:39,905 --> 00:12:42,699
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I-I should already be immune to being
rejected for these kinds of things by now...</font>

163
00:12:42,783 --> 00:12:45,619
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Morning.</font>

164
00:12:47,788 --> 00:12:49,247
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Good morning.</font>

165
00:12:50,040 --> 00:12:55,670
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So, first period's math for you, huh?
- We're split up for now then. -Y-Yeah.</font>

166
00:12:56,505 --> 00:13:00,133
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh yeah... I brought the
dog home. He's been good!</font>

167
00:13:02,052 --> 00:13:04,971
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Though we haven't decided on a name yet.</font>

168
00:13:05,055 --> 00:13:08,767
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- You'll be just fine.
- Kazehaya!</font>

169
00:13:09,351 --> 00:13:10,268
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah!</font>

170
00:13:11,102 --> 00:13:12,020
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">See ya later!</font>

171
00:13:19,945 --> 00:13:23,323
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I hope... the cookies I
baked make him happy.</font>

172
00:13:25,826 --> 00:13:31,790
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- There's an open seat there!
- Uh, way up in the front? For real?</font>

173
00:13:32,707 --> 00:13:35,961
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's not that bad, right? And the seat
next to it's open. By the way, who usually</font>

174
00:13:36,044 --> 00:13:40,215
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- sits here, anyway?
- It's Sadako's seat.</font>

175
00:13:40,298 --> 00:13:41,633
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Uh... Sadako?</font>

176
00:13:43,552 --> 00:13:46,471
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- You know Yuka who sat in Sadako's seat?
- Hmm? She was out sick</font>

177
00:13:46,555 --> 00:13:49,516
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">with a cold for a whole week.</font>

178
00:13:50,642 --> 00:13:51,560
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You got this.</font>

179
00:13:56,064 --> 00:13:56,982
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Excuse me.</font>

180
00:13:57,065 --> 00:13:57,983
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Hm?
- Hm?</font>

181
00:13:59,276 --> 00:14:02,362
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Don't worry... it isn't dirty.</font>

182
00:14:02,445 --> 00:14:05,657
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">A- And nothing bad
will happen in that seat.</font>

183
00:14:06,449 --> 00:14:09,035
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I don't... have any powers like that.</font>

184
00:14:10,203 --> 00:14:11,121
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Plus...</font>

185
00:14:12,038 --> 00:14:15,750
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I don't... have a sixth
sense or anything either.</font>

186
00:14:16,626 --> 00:14:17,669
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I said it!</font>

187
00:14:19,337 --> 00:14:20,881
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I really said it.</font>

188
00:14:28,221 --> 00:14:29,431
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Next time...</font>

189
00:14:31,641 --> 00:14:33,810
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">There's always... next time.</font>

190
00:14:41,484 --> 00:14:45,113
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I can't expect things
to change that easily.</font>

191
00:14:45,196 --> 00:14:47,908
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Right. So, for homeroom, we'll be
rearranging the seating. You can figure it</font>

192
00:14:47,991 --> 00:14:50,702
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">out on your own.</font>

193
00:14:54,039 --> 00:14:56,207
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Just don't get too rowdy, okay?</font>

194
00:14:57,626 --> 00:15:02,380
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- All right! Seating change!
- He uh... doesn't look good does he?</font>

195
00:15:02,464 --> 00:15:05,717
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah... Doesn't it seem like he
started falling apart after summer break?</font>

196
00:15:05,800 --> 00:15:09,095
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Summer bre...</font>

197
00:15:10,388 --> 00:15:14,559
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Is it because he dumped all those
random duties on Sadako over summer break?</font>

198
00:15:14,643 --> 00:15:18,355
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You know Sadako's seat
neighbor Ueda? His grades dropped.</font>

199
00:15:18,438 --> 00:15:22,192
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- And Nakanishi broke his leg, didn't he?
- He was joking around during the</font>

200
00:15:22,275 --> 00:15:25,570
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">test-of-courage and said some nasty stuff
to Sadako...</font>

201
00:15:25,654 --> 00:15:28,990
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- A- Anywhoo. Lets do that seating change.
- O-Okay!</font>

202
00:15:30,075 --> 00:15:32,285
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">A seating change, huh?</font>

203
00:15:32,369 --> 00:15:38,041
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I hope this time... I can get along
better with the people sitting next to me.</font>

204
00:15:40,210 --> 00:15:45,632
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Am I just imagining things?... Or is
everyone in this classroom staring at me?</font>

205
00:15:45,715 --> 00:15:51,137
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Please... don't place me in front of,
behind, beside, or diagonally to Sadako!</font>

206
00:15:51,221 --> 00:15:53,974
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Kazehaya, what's yours?
- Thirty-two.</font>

207
00:15:54,057 --> 00:15:56,434
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey! I'm seated right next to you.</font>

208
00:15:56,518 --> 00:15:58,937
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Seriously? Switch with me!</font>

209
00:16:00,021 --> 00:16:01,648
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Please! Please! I'm begging you!
- Wow... just like that...</font>

210
00:16:01,731 --> 00:16:03,400
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kazehaya's surrounded.</font>

211
00:16:04,693 --> 00:16:08,113
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's a little lonely not being able to
share joy over sitting by a friend... or</font>

212
00:16:08,196 --> 00:16:11,616
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">disappointment over
being seated far away.</font>

213
00:16:11,700 --> 00:16:14,119
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Aw, man! I'm stuck at the very front.</font>

214
00:16:14,202 --> 00:16:16,621
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You poor thing!</font>

215
00:16:19,749 --> 00:16:20,667
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Jeez...</font>

216
00:16:22,627 --> 00:16:23,920
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Um...</font>

217
00:16:24,004 --> 00:16:27,298
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I pulled a seat in the very
back row, so, if you'd like... here...</font>

218
00:16:27,382 --> 00:16:30,719
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">No! That's okay! I'm sorry I'm sorryyyy!</font>

219
00:16:32,220 --> 00:16:35,140
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Hey, Sadako's number 3 you guys!
- What numbers are around her?</font>

220
00:16:35,223 --> 00:16:38,351
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}Twelve, nineteen, twenty-five!</font>

221
00:16:38,435 --> 00:16:39,978
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}Alright! It's not me!</font>

222
00:16:40,061 --> 00:16:44,149
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}Especially watch out if you're
number 19! That's right next to her!</font>

223
00:16:44,232 --> 00:16:48,361
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Th-That really stings... I can
hear everything they're saying.</font>

224
00:16:51,322 --> 00:16:53,575
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But... that's just how it is.</font>

225
00:16:54,659 --> 00:16:58,538
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Someday, I hope I'll be able to share
the happiness of being at my seat with</font>

226
00:16:58,621 --> 00:17:02,500
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">someone... That would be nice.</font>

227
00:17:03,334 --> 00:17:04,961
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Whoever's 19... trade me.</font>

228
00:17:06,588 --> 00:17:08,465
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">... What?</font>

229
00:17:09,632 --> 00:17:10,550
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Kazehaya?
- Hey.</font>

230
00:17:11,760 --> 00:17:12,886
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What's going on?</font>

231
00:17:21,478 --> 00:17:23,438
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Alright! Next to Kuronuma.</font>

232
00:17:32,238 --> 00:17:33,907
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I don't want this.</font>

233
00:17:43,208 --> 00:17:44,876
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yoshida... you're next.</font>

234
00:17:44,959 --> 00:17:47,670
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Nah... I'm good right here.</font>

235
00:17:51,007 --> 00:17:52,342
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You need somethin'?</font>

236
00:17:52,425 --> 00:17:54,177
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ugh! Get outta here, Ryu!</font>

237
00:17:54,260 --> 00:17:55,178
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">No thanks.</font>

238
00:17:55,261 --> 00:17:58,515
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- This isn't about you!
- Weird. ' Last I checked... this</font>

239
00:17:58,598 --> 00:18:01,851
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">was mine... the far back window seat.</font>

240
00:18:13,154 --> 00:18:14,114
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Um...</font>

241
00:18:14,197 --> 00:18:16,032
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Hm?
- Hm?</font>

242
00:18:16,116 --> 00:18:17,951
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">These... are... some thank you
cookies for yesterday If you don't mind.</font>

243
00:18:18,034 --> 00:18:19,869
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ooo!</font>

244
00:18:22,914 --> 00:18:24,165
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">For me too?</font>

245
00:18:24,249 --> 00:18:26,251
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yes... And I wanted to
return the tracksuit I borrowed.</font>

246
00:18:26,334 --> 00:18:28,378
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Woah!</font>

247
00:18:29,129 --> 00:18:30,755
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">They're really amazing!</font>

248
00:18:33,133 --> 00:18:34,050
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Thank you.</font>

249
00:18:35,468 --> 00:18:37,679
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Did you... bake those for us?</font>

250
00:18:37,762 --> 00:18:39,097
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Uh-huh.</font>

251
00:18:39,889 --> 00:18:42,392
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'll savor every bite of this treat.</font>

252
00:18:43,476 --> 00:18:45,854
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Wow, you're right, they're good.</font>

253
00:18:46,980 --> 00:18:47,897
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hungry.</font>

254
00:18:49,107 --> 00:18:52,652
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Don't you just eat
lunch a few minutes ago?</font>

255
00:18:52,735 --> 00:18:53,653
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm hu-</font>

256
00:19:03,454 --> 00:19:04,372
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hmm...</font>

257
00:19:10,587 --> 00:19:11,504
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">This seat...</font>

258
00:19:12,964 --> 00:19:14,174
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">...Makes me so happy...</font>

259
00:19:19,053 --> 00:19:19,971
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I...</font>

260
00:19:22,807 --> 00:19:24,017
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Don't have words.</font>

261
00:19:27,103 --> 00:19:28,229
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm happy.</font>

262
00:19:49,709 --> 00:19:50,627
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kuronuma!</font>

263
00:19:54,756 --> 00:20:00,303
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Good. I was worried you were crying.
- Th- That was really shameful, wasn't it?</font>

264
00:20:03,556 --> 00:20:04,891
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So that's shameful?</font>

265
00:20:08,478 --> 00:20:14,817
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I get it now... The reason why I don't
feel any distance between me and Kazehaya.</font>

266
00:20:14,901 --> 00:20:19,405
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's because he always closes the
distance... ...the distance I've always</font>

267
00:20:19,489 --> 00:20:23,993
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">struggled to fill...
Effortlessly... with just a smile.</font>

268
00:20:26,663 --> 00:20:31,125
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Isn't that Kazehaya and Sadako?
- Yeah.</font>

269
00:20:31,209 --> 00:20:35,672
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Haven't they been together a lot lately?
- I wonder if she... actually got rejected.</font>

270
00:20:40,802 --> 00:20:42,428
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">See you tomorrow.</font>

271
00:20:44,138 --> 00:20:49,936
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">The deep admiration and respect I have
for you... are still as strong as ever.</font>

272
00:20:52,689 --> 00:20:53,606
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But...</font>

273
00:20:55,566 --> 00:20:57,819
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">At some point along the way...</font>

274
00:20:58,945 --> 00:21:03,908
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">...My feelings grew beyond those
things, and something new was born.</font>

275
00:21:04,784 --> 00:21:07,245
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">A much bigger feeling for you.</font>

276
00:21:09,080 --> 00:21:10,832
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">...And stronger too.</font>

277
00:22:27,200 --> 00:22:31,245
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">My brand new seat... My
dream... is becoming a reality.</font>

278
00:22:33,289 --> 00:22:35,375
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Next time: "After School"</font>
